{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "45329681fa0fa448932e53a7808080d5446ba465a868c5314f074ca35a18c983", "ja": "ユニット告知用のスチル撮影にきた3人。楽\nしみにしていた様子の育と桃子だが、スタイ\nルの良さから、環が一番高い評価を受ける。\n育と桃子は悔しがりつつ、今日から牛乳を飲\nむ！　と、ライバル意識を見せるのだった。", "zh": "前来拍摄用于宣传组合的剧照的3人。育和桃子似乎一直很期待这次拍摄，但由于环的身材条件最好，获得了最高评价。\n育和桃子虽然感到不甘心，却表示从今天开始要喝牛奶！就这样展现出了竞争意识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed83627b24a31751ac8fb46ad83320619858e1dae900708deedfa4ab9c10c300", "ja": "（先方に企画が通り、プチプラコスメとタイアップ\nするユニットは、環、育、桃子の3人に決定した！）", "zh": "（对方通过了企划，决定由环、育和桃子这3人组成与平价化妆品联动的组合！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9f867ee262a957cbd50974dfeb232933573560a45aa3ae7c839c01569fe19925", "ja": "（今日は、その告知のためのスチル撮影……。\n3人には、衣装に着替えてもらった）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄用于宣传的静照……。让3人换上了服装）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "2cc22e6d74906eb6750bca36672afe0865d65df24f5aa432a6105d7c891b49a5", "ja": "いよいよ、今日からだね！\nコスメブランドの、モデルさんのお仕事……！", "zh": "终于从今天开始啦！\n彩妆品牌的模特工作……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "1a70b56a9bc4258c445d2afa3e72669389566c2199e25d178e190aa257a82261", "ja": "わたし、すっごく楽しみで、昨日は\nなかなか眠れなかったんだ……ふあぁ。", "zh": "我特别期待，昨晚\n都好久没睡着……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "a35085a4b13a708fbf19dfc027bdcbd3c07aa62d0c92fe03dc5e86d9d031016f", "ja": "もう……育、ちょっとはしゃぎすぎじゃない？\n楽しみなのはわかるけど……ふあぁ。", "zh": "真是的……育，你是不是有点太兴奋了？\n我知道你很期待……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "237c9f8665c2e569331369d051d0f4b2c753f2cf3231ece371c4774c1c10a29a", "ja": "あれ？　ももこも、あくびしてるけど……\n眠いの？", "zh": "咦？桃子也打哈欠了呢……\n很困吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "395211aa7f742d21946f5f6a8557b0b6db5b28954e1d64345093024d20d8c25c", "ja": "も、桃子は資料を読み込んでて、寝るのが\n遅くなっちゃっただけ！　仕事の準備！", "zh": "桃、桃子只是看资料看得太入迷，睡晚了而已！是在准备工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "3acba26e3335ad7f0fcf840bb7d66684bf402405afc75391ef016995bbd0732a", "ja": "準備なら、たまきもしたぞ～！　おやぶんがくれた\n紙に、『自然に、大人っぽく』って書いてあった！", "zh": "准备的话，环也做好了哦～！制作人给我的纸上写着“自然点，成熟点”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "6625c87218f7ac0b030c6c6eef93a6387a14275a3bcb55445c4d5dea0ba4c698", "ja": "うん！　だから今日はわたし、\nめいっぱい大人っぽく決めちゃうんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！所以今天我要尽情展现成熟的一面♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "fa20c74bf12c6d0f0092d52c1a071bf2ded0bf6a493454b57bdea57913cfb324", "ja": "桃子の場合は、いつもどおりにしてるだけで、\nOKもらえると思うけどね。ふふん♪", "zh": "桃子的话，只要像平时一样，我觉得就能得到认可了。哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "939c00e812ea5d137017df1d3513a864389f38d96a506fd60e306f68ef1ebea9", "ja": "たまきは……ねえねえ、おやぶん。\nたまきは、どんな感じにすればいいの？", "zh": "环是……那个，老大。\n环要摆出什么样的感觉才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a0271fdc0a3ae47bbf0a29f0d545f841a349d452d9da279fb1a0816096919d55", "ja": "そうだな。今日の写真は告知用のスチルだから、\nみんな普段どおりでいいと思うけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛，今天的照片是用来宣传的剧照，所以我觉得大家像平时一样就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "909430da94cbd38860eeecf7a2692123637ddd4bf11d1ef8398e9a7dedcdf369", "ja": "あとはカメラマンさんの指示に従って\n撮ってもらえれば、大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "只要之后听摄影师的指示拍摄，\n我觉得就不会有问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "e002d087002f30803be321e8d61706726944d2adf8a9500a22a970ee7a047a73", "ja": "わかった！　カメラマンさんの言うこときいて、\nたまき、がんばる！", "zh": "知道了！听摄影师的话，\n环努力拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "befd7227249d46e58ae6e5be0263e23c707f41815ce98928951c642a3ff63ce6", "ja": "たまきがいちばんに撮るんだね！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "环要第一个拍摄对吧！\n请多多关照啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1015_camman", "source_sha256": "105acef95e731930dfe2f54123c8f500fe550f8b064798c02a1a47b49ac79e61", "ja": "環ちゃん、今日も元気いっぱいで素敵ね！\nでも今日は……背筋を伸ばして立ってみてくれる？", "zh": "小环，今天也活力满满，真棒呢！\n不过今天……可以试着挺直腰板站好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "78289e15614640f08533e8c6fe372dd3ccefa6b6ca4fddafb04239337641c98a", "ja": "背すじをのばす……。\nえーと……こう？", "zh": "挺直背脊……。\n嗯……这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1017_camman", "source_sha256": "75db42a4d6b66ea33e08d4c986aab989b1392961f085a24e4c4694ff3e029130", "ja": "む……いいですね！\nそのままで何枚か撮らせてね！", "zh": "唔……很不错呢！\n保持这样让我拍几张吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1018_se", "source_sha256": "a393f153beba9193b68690ab68995c288177bc7f37c7bc43dd123a77901ceb5e", "ja": "カシャカシャカシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "843a73bfdeb017cbd8652eb551ef6401e9d9022588a135dbd2c9de600d521e8a", "ja": "あ、あれ？　環って、あんなに足長かったっけ？\nたしかに、桃子たちの中では一番年上だけど……。", "zh": "啊，咦？环的腿原来有那么长吗？\n确实，虽然在桃子她们当中是年纪最大的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "98e0b2d66777a92b217e1b9ac53a35b988d21af11bf07091dd35a6bd090b4b9e", "ja": "うん！　手も足も、すらーってしてて……\n環ちゃんって、すっごくスタイルいいんだね……！", "zh": "嗯！手脚都修长匀称的……\n环，身材真是太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1021_camman", "source_sha256": "f545641d07cb6a9f5905cbf4e61c5a4e5bdbf2a585e83d162a33b30433dc78e6", "ja": "立ってるだけで、これだけ決まるなんて……\n環ちゃん、大人っぽくていい感じですよ！", "zh": "光是站着就能有这么好的效果……\n环，显得很成熟，感觉真不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "7f485e2e9b5cf58cef6431be9fda587ecdbb89f31d12ac19c45069c292d36f86", "ja": "え、えへへ。たまき、\nそんなにオトナっぽい……？", "zh": "呃，嘿嘿。环看起来真的那么成熟吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "9827e4f66a207ae2b44d386118c4a38f6855150d0c671cfa040e8baf70a3023b", "ja": "育。桃子たちも、負けてられないよ。", "zh": "育。桃子我们也不能输呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "b85cb6ba6ae9d1b7b3a48dc0dbe4b4eeba0a445019e78b0e7470a5856050a318", "ja": "う、うん！\nわたしだって……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！\n我也可以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1025_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "21407502bcf7ec2be523fe2cbbb966e023096d8883492ca837c7c6d0cf1c11b1", "ja": "よし、これで今日の撮影は終わりだな。\n綺麗に撮ってもらえてよかったな、3人とも！", "zh": "好，这样今天的拍摄就结束了。\n能拍得这么漂亮真是太好了，你们3个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "911afcc966b3d640a43b7e1dacab052a2453ec6092ffbe1ca2d27ec16b520d2f", "ja": "うん！　たまき、すっごく楽しかったぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！环，今天特别开心哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "29a4726007b0d536184e798fd7a11fda8a9d2314f47628854c0429051254f6f9", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ。育、桃子。\nふたりとも、いい感じだったと思うけど……。", "zh": "怎、怎么了，育、桃子。\n我觉得你们两个表现得都挺不错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "51c75ca779f466997fb41150f467d0301745f102c6e19048f24e0cd9a454c0c5", "ja": "いい感じなのはトーゼンでしょ、桃子もプロだからね。\nでも、環がこんなにモデル向きだったなんて……。", "zh": "感觉好是当然的吧，桃子也是专业的嘛。\n不过，没想到环居然这么适合当模特……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "fbeb084fbf5d6e5867b93afb84d5a21173772e5ced9864f774a23cdc145874a1", "ja": "同じポーズをとってるはずなのに、\nわたしたちと、ぜんぜんちがうんだもん……。", "zh": "明明摆的是同一个姿势，\n感觉却跟我们完全不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "afd7223aff2bd011d390df85559f932f1893639b0087e26303e2eb31e6b982e6", "ja": "確かに、環のスタイルには改めて驚かされたけど……\n育と桃子だって、ちゃんと違った魅力があるよ。", "zh": "确实，环的身材让人再次叹为观止，不过……\n育和桃子也各有各的魅力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "4ec7cbbee3a41369dceecb8b0772729d48549d2fc049e8293a0ecce5664fccce", "ja": "{$P$}さん、それほんとう？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，那是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "b170bd90be9a591c4d7e7ca2c3e141be386fa372e3e3cfcbccfe090a97f64273", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　環は背が高いから、\nふたりより、ちょっと大人っぽかったけどな。", "zh": "啊，当然！环因为个子高，\n所以比你们两个稍微显得成熟一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "1aa2e8a1f172aff2f9c61ec8842bc35e69ad434f34d99fff416a379d84b57736", "ja": "むう……。だから、それが気になるの！\n桃子だって、もうすこし身長があれば……。", "zh": "唔……就是因为这样桃子才在意的啊！\n桃子要是能再稍微长高一点的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1037_040tam", "source_sha256": "eca9b7f5ca6776a7a9a2b00b147c85a222edbe1ea0f8f36b88e4ff4587ea41d6", "ja": "ももこ、背が高くなりたいの？　だったら、\n牛乳を飲むといいって、ばあちゃんが言ってたぞ！", "zh": "桃子想长高吗？那就喝牛奶吧，奶奶是这么说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "4dad0c28a2c760c064ff056b9b4eee246501a865f6260c5a8072ec705856c355", "ja": "環ちゃんは、牛乳飲んでるの？", "zh": "环，你喝牛奶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "04ea38c67efc97292cfddef69ef5b1fefce87a035ae205256c33533c92c17952", "ja": "うん！　たまき、牛乳好きだぞ！\nおいしいし！", "zh": "嗯！环最喜欢牛奶了！\n因为很好喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "eb357d0b293e8e4608b87426d9c7aea43d01f144d7de1c79d438266fdf7139f8", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……帰りにコンビニ寄って。\n桃子、今日から牛乳飲む！", "zh": "哥哥……回去的时候去趟便利店。\n桃子从今天开始要喝牛奶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "4d5c1416a84900effee27eeef84d33a34f9be9efeb44f48bd1253d3b844c8816", "ja": "あっ、桃子ちゃんずるいよ、わたしも飲む！\nふたつ買ってね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊，桃子好狡猾，我也要喝！\n买两瓶哦，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "591ac604de4b69d6255345750fb6aff4febe1ce7046fe3a47d7e6c98df77e9bc", "ja": "あ、ああ。わかった。\n牛乳の1本や2本、お安い御用だ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊。知道了。\n牛奶要1瓶还是2瓶，包在我身上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "e5260815f089b7f3bc504331872e2a8af80604041c6c308b5702112b1316712d", "ja": "（環との違いを実感した事で、ふたりには\nライバル意識が芽生えたみたいだ……）", "zh": "（意识到两人的不同之后，她们似乎产生了竞争意识……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "8bd4beffa03e8e21e3d183f823b2c89bdf28fe1ccf44bca1e2c1d151a05607a8", "ja": "（企画段階から、想定外の方向へと転がっていく……\nこのユニット、意外な形になるかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（从企划阶段开始，就朝着意料之外的方向发展……这个组合，说不定会变成出人意料的样子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
